---
title: Tinto de verano
servings: 6
tags: [cocktail, wine, spanish, summer]
cuisine: spanish
time: 1 minute
source: Tinto de Verano (Spanish Summer Drink) by Alba Luna Meyer, Recipes from Europe, https://www.recipesfromeurope.com/tinto-de-verano
---

Slice the @lemons{2} into wheels. Fill a #large pitcher{} with ice and most of the lemon. Pour in @red wine{25%fl_oz} to fill it halfway, top with @lemon soda{15%fl_oz}, and stir well. Pour into #wine glasses{} over more ice, with a lemon wheel on the rim.

> Use a young, low-tannin red. For one glass, mix it in the same ratio over ice.
